  <string name="help_title">Help &amp; support</string>
  <string name="help_subtitle">Quick answers, then a human if you still need one.</string>
  <string name="help_q1">How does Decide For Us work?</string>
  <string name="help_a1">Every saved activity enters YES/NO rounds. Options that cannot reach a majority are eliminated, survivors go forward, and the last one standing is your winner. Vote totals are always visible after the round closes.</string>
  <string name="help_q2">What happens offline?</string>
  <string name="help_a2">Your group, ideas and votes are cached on the device. Adding or voting offline is timestamped, queued, and sent when your connection returns. If somebody else changed the same thing, VIBE shows you the conflict instead of quietly overwriting it.</string>
  <string name="help_q3">Can I change the language and theme?</string>
  <string name="help_a3">Yes. Settings has English, isiZulu and Sesotho, plus a dark and light theme. Alerts follow the same choice.</string>
  <string name="help_q4">Who can start a round?</string>
  <string name="help_a4">The group owner starts a round, but every member gets exactly one YES/NO vote per activity.</string>
